---
description: Documentation and project-memory rules
globs: ["**/*.md", "**/*.mdc"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Documentation must match reality.

When implementation state changes, update `docs/PROJECT_STATE.md`.
When durable architecture changes, create or update an ADR.
Do not mark planned work as implemented.
Do not create empty docs merely to look complete.
Keep `AGENTS.md` concise; put detailed procedures in skills and detailed domain knowledge in `docs/`.
